---
import learning from '../data/learning.json';
import Shell from '../layouts/Shell.astro';
import Filters from '../components/Filters.astro';
import { cases } from '../data/content.json';
const entries=cases;
const topics=[...new Set(entries.map(item=>item.topic))];
---
<Shell title="Halal Business Decisions"><section class="intro"><span class="eyebrow">A business decision lab</span> <h1 class="editorial">{learning.heading}</h1> <p>Twelve fictional cases put disclosure, promises and fair dealing into ordinary business situations. Read what happens, then return to the sources.</p></section><div class="evidence-band"><span>Two decisions per case</span> <span>Fictional consequences</span> <a href="/sources/">Read the methodology <span aria-hidden="true">→</span></a></div><p class="bookmarks-note">These cases are educational applied reasoning. They do not certify real transactions, issue personalized rulings or replace legal or financial advice.</p><Filters topics={topics}/><div class="collection-tools"><h2 id="entries">Choose a case</h2> <button class="button secondary" id="copy-saved">Copy my list</button></div> <div class="card-grid">{entries.map(item=><><article class="panel activity-card" data-item-id={item.id} data-search={`${item.title} ${item.topic} ${item.setup}`} data-topic={item.topic}><span class="eyebrow">{item.topic}</span> <h2><a data-reading-link={item.id} href={`/case/${item.id}/`}>{item.title}</a></h2> <p>{item.setup}</p> <span class="micro">{'Two decisions · source reading'}</span> <div class="actions"><a class="button" href={`/case/${item.id}/`}>Open case</a> <button class="button secondary" data-save={item.id} aria-pressed="false">Save</button></div></article>{' '}</>)}</div> <div id="empty" class="empty" hidden><h2>Nothing matches</h2> <p>Try fewer words, change a filter, or turn off “Saved only.”</p></div><script>import "../lib/library";</script></Shell>